[{"title":"赠诗僧道通","author":"苏轼","text":"雄豪而妙苦而腴，祇有琴聪与蜜殊。\n语带烟霞从古少，气含蔬笋到公无。\n香林乍喜闻薝卜，古井惟愁断辘轳。\n为报韩公莫轻许，从今岛、可是诗奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77153,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张竞辰永康所居万卷堂","author":"苏轼","text":"君家四壁如相如，卷藏天禄吞石渠。\n岂惟邺侯三万轴，家有世南行秘书。\n儿童拍手笑何事，笑人空腹谈经义。\n未许中郎得异书，且共扬雄说奇字。\n清江萦山碧玉环，下有老龙千古闲。\n知君好事家有酒，化为老人夜扣关。\n留侯之孙书满腹，玉函宝方何用读。\n濠梁空复五车多，圯上从来一编足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77154,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘壮舆长官是是堂","author":"苏轼","text":"閒燕言仁义，是非安可无。\n非非义之属，是是仁之徒。\n非非近乎讪，是是近乎谀。\n当为感麟翁，善恶分锱铢。\n抑为阮嗣宗，臧否两含糊。\n刘君有家学，三世道益孤。\n陈古以刺今，紬史行天诛。\n皎如大明镜，百陋逢一姝。\n鹗立时四顾，何由扰群狐。\n作堂名是是，自说行坦途。\n孜孜称善人，不善自远徂。\n愿君置座右，此语禹所谟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77155,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予昔作《壶中九华》诗，其后八年，复过湖口，则石已为好事者取去，乃和前韵以自解云","author":"苏轼","text":"江边阵马走千峰，问讯方知冀北空。\n尤物已随清梦断，真形犹在画图中。\n归来晚岁同元亮，却扫何人伴敬通。\n赖有铜盆修石供，仇池玉色自璁珑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77156,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵郭功甫观予画雪雀有感二首 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"早知臭腐即神奇，海北天南总是归。\n九万里风安税驾，云鹏今悔不卑飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77157,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵郭功甫观予画雪雀有感二首 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"可怜倦鸟不知时，空羡骑鲸得所归。\n玉局西南天一角，万人沙苑看孤飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77158,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"追忆郭功父观余旧画雪鹊，复作二韵寄之，时在惠州","author":"苏轼","text":"平生才力信瑰奇，今在穷荒岂易归。\n正似雪林枝上画，羽翰虽好不能飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77159,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复官北归再次前韵","author":"苏轼","text":"秋霜春雨不同时，万里今从海外归。\n已出网罗毛羽在，却寻云迹帖天飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77160,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵法芝举旧诗一首","author":"苏轼","text":"春来何处不归鸿，非复羸牛踏旧踪。\n但愿老师心似月，谁家瓮里不相逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77161,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次旧韵赠清凉长老","author":"苏轼","text":"过淮入洛地多尘，举扇西风欲污人。\n但怪云山不改色，岂知江月解分身。\n安心有道年颜好，遇物无情句法新。\n送我长芦舟一叶，笑看雪浪满衣巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77162,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠孙公素","author":"苏轼","text":"披扇当年笑温峤，握刀晚岁战刘郎。\n不须戚戚如冯衍，便与时时说李阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77163,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起，闻米元章冒热到东园送麦门冬饮子","author":"苏轼","text":"一枕清风直万钱，无人肯买北窗眠。\n开心暖胃门冬饮，知是东坡手自煎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77164,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦中作寄朱行中","author":"苏轼","text":"舜不作六器，谁知贵玙璠。\n哀哉楚狂士，抱璞号空山。\n相如起睨柱，头璧与俱还。\n何如郑子产，有礼国自闲。\n虽微韩宣子，鄙夫亦辞环。\n至今不贪宝，凛然照尘寰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77165,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答径山琳长老","author":"苏轼","text":"与君皆丙子，各已三万日。\n一日一千偈，电往那容诘。\n大患缘有身，无身则无疾。\n平生笑罗什，神咒真浪出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77166,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：皇帝阁六首 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"霭霭龙旂色，琅琅木铎音。\n数行宽大诏，四海发生心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77167,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：皇帝阁六首 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"旸谷宾初日，清台告协风。\n愿如风有信，长与日俱中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77168,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：皇帝阁六首 其三","author":"苏轼","text":"草木渐知春，萌芽处处新。\n从今八千岁，合抱是灵椿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77169,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：皇帝阁六首 其四","author":"苏轼","text":"圣主忧民未解颜，天教瑞雪报丰年。\n苍龙挂阙农祥正，老稚相呼看藉田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77170,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：皇帝阁六首 其五","author":"苏轼","text":"昨夜东风入律新，玉关知有受降人。\n圣恩与解河湟冻，共得中原草木春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77171,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：皇帝阁六首 其六","author":"苏轼","text":"翰林职在明光里，行乐诗成拜舞中。\n不待惊开小桃杏，始知天子是天公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77172,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：太皇太后阁六首 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"雕刻春何力，欣荣物自知。\n发生虽有象，覆载本无私。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77173,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：太皇太后阁六首 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"小殿黄金榜，珠帘白玉钩。\n一声双日跸，春色满皇州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77174,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：太皇太后阁六首 其三","author":"苏轼","text":"仗下春朝散，宫中昼漏稀。\n两厢休侍御，应下读书帏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77175,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春帖子词：太皇太后阁六首 其四","author":"苏轼","text":"五日占云十日风，忧勤终岁为三农。\n春来有喜何人见，好学神孙类祖宗